<title>SWEDEN: Volvo says Frisinger acting chairman.</title>
<headline>Volvo says Frisinger acting chairman.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo said on Wednesday that board member and former chief executive Hakan Frisinger would act as the company's chairman, replacing Bert-Olof Svanholm, until the AGM on April 23.  </p>
<p>Svanholm, 62, died on Tuesday after a lengthy illness.</p>
<p>Frisinger has been a member of Volvo's board since 1994, Volvo said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
